     m_sContent "Russian motor rifle company staging at the sawmill, with further forces approaching from the north."\
     ""\
     "Estimated company-strength VDV screening south of the sawmill, between our current location and the objective."\
     ""\
     "Wearing EMR, operating vehicles such as BTR-70s, BRDMs."
